    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> implementation that orchestrates transaction creation, commits and rollbacks to a\nlist of delegates. Using this implementation assumes that errors causing a transaction rollback will usually happen\nbefore the transaction completion or during the commit of the most inner <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>的类负责协调向一组委托创建、提交和回滚事务。使用此实现假设导致事务回滚的错误通常会在最内层<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>的事务完成之前或在其提交期间发生。",
